{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06108","headline":"苑舍人能书梵字兼达梵音皆曲尽其妙戏爲之赠 · 王维","name":"苑舍人能书梵字兼达梵音皆曲尽其妙戏爲之赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名儒待诏满公车，才子爲郎典石渠。\n莲花法藏心悬悟，贝叶经文手自书。\n楚词共许胜杨马，梵字何人辨鲁鱼。\n故旧相望在三事，愿君莫厌承明庐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06108.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06108","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}